<title>GERMANY: German ad agency BBDO Duesseldorf hires new executive.</title>
<headline>German ad agency BBDO Duesseldorf hires new executive.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German advertising agency BBDO Duesseldorf said on Thursday it had appointed a new executive creative director.</p>
<p>Jan van Meel, 42, of the Netherlands will take up the post on July 1.</p>
<p>Van Meel will lead BBDO Duesseldorf with current managing director Ralf Neumann. He was previously the manager of creative development at AP Lintas in Hamburg.</p>
